{
  "status": "applied",
  "key": "thumbnail_format",
  "value": "webp",
  "rationale": "webp is the smallest supported thumbnail format at ~20 KB, compared to jpeg (~30 KB) and png (~80 KB). The project's own test evidence confirms all target browsers and the deployed image pipeline pass webp compatibility tests, making it the optimal choice for minimising payload size without sacrificing support."
}
